@startuml
title Drill 11 Player State Machine
[*] --> IDLE
IDLE --> WALK : Left / Right
WALK --> IDLE : No walking direction
IDLE --> SLEEP : idle time >= 5 s
SLEEP --> WALK : Left / Right (wake up)
IDLE --> AUTO_RUN : A = left / D = right
WALK --> AUTO_RUN : A / D
SLEEP --> AUTO_RUN : A / D (wake up)
AUTO_RUN --> IDLE : auto time >= 5 s AND speed = 0
note bottom of IDLE
  8 fps; speed = 0
end note
note bottom of WALK
  8 fps; 100 px/s
end note
note bottom of SLEEP
  2 fps; face upwards
end note
note bottom of AUTO_RUN
  8 fps; scale = 200%
  Accelerate, then brake; clamp speed to 0
  Reflect at walls only when moving outwards
  Reflections keep the timer and braking phase
  Arrows and extra A / D do not change AUTO_RUN
end note
legend bottom
  Same-frame input: AUTO_RUN first; D over A; Left + Right = neutral.
  Held arrows after AUTO_RUN must be released and pressed again.
endlegend
@enduml
